sentences.l:
But he sent forth Talthybius, lord Agamemnon,
to the hollow ships to go, and a lamb he ordered
to be brought;

by old age indeed from war having ceased, but speakers
good, like cicadas, which in the forest
on a tree sitting a lily-like voice send out;

Indeed, by a head even taller are others,
but one so fine I have never yet seen with my eyes,
nor one so stately;
